    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-βλήδην</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραβάλλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thrown in by the way</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερτομίοις ἐπέεσσι π. ἀγορεύων</span> speaking <i>with
